  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Botswana Programmatic Economic Resilience and Green Recovery Development Policy Loan II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objectives of the Second Programmatic Economic Resilience and Green Recovery Development Policy Loan for Botswana are: (a) to support the government&apos;s response to multiple shocks; (b) to strengthen private sector development; and (c) to promote a resilient, low-carbon recovery. The operation supports key pillars of the government&apos;s economic recovery and transformation plan (ERTP) and the reset and reclaim agenda and is fully aligned with the World Bank Group&apos;s (WBG) Country Partnership Framework (CPF) for Botswana for FY16-21. It builds on the WBG&apos;s 2021 green, resilient, and inclusive development (GRID) approach and draws on the 2022 global crisis response framework (GCRF).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program development objectives (PDOs) are: (a) to support the government&apos;s response to multiple shocks; (b) to strengthen private sector development; and (c) to promote a resilient, low-carbon recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
